{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory contains serious responsibility-chain failures: the doctor reassured and interpreted results before completing current pediatric danger-sign assessment, never assessed seizure risk, and did not ensure the incomplete outside imaging was handed to the treating team. The statement that consolidation generally resolves and “不会留下长期后遗症” is an overly certain prognosis prohibited by RC7. Although the doctor appropriately discouraged self-directed medication changes and established bedside escalation, serious RC1, RC5, and RC7 errors mandate grade 1.",
